{"4448240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Thunder Hoop Collection (QUByte Classics)", "steam_appid": 4448240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The thrill of 90s arcade action is back!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the complete saga of Gaelco’s cult-classic platformers with Thunder Hoop Collection, featuring the original 1992 arcade hit Thunder Hoop and its explosive 1994 sequel, TH Strikes Back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go back to the golden era of coin-ops and test your reflexes against a bio-organic nightmare. When the mad scientist Professor Genbreak unleashes an army of uncontrollable, genetically engineered creatures upon the world, humanity’s only hope lies in a powerful bio-engineered hero developed in a secret laboratory: Thunder Hoop! Climb ladders, leap across hazardous platforms, and smash dangerous bosses to halt a global catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are controlling the young hero in the original classic or dominating the battlefield as a powerful adult warrior in the sequel, prepare for pure, uncompromising arcade fun. Master your combat skills, unlock devastating weapon power-ups, and enjoy the definitive way to experience these forgotten retro gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Games in One: Play both the legendary Thunder Hoop (1992) and its simultaneous 2-player sequel TH Strikes Back (1994).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind Function: Undo costly mistakes and perfect your platforming runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save States: Save and load your game at any moment so you never lose your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Screen Filters: Relive the genuine arcade atmosphere with customizable CRT and classic TV effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer: Face the mutant hordes with a friend in alternating turns or simultaneous co-op action.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The thrill of 90s arcade action is back!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the complete saga of Gaelco’s cult-classic platformers with Thunder Hoop Collection, featuring the original 1992 arcade hit Thunder Hoop and its explosive 1994 sequel, TH Strikes Back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go back to the golden era of coin-ops and test your reflexes against a bio-organic nightmare. When the mad scientist Professor Genbreak unleashes an army of uncontrollable, genetically engineered creatures upon the world, humanity’s only hope lies in a powerful bio-engineered hero developed in a secret laboratory: Thunder Hoop! Climb ladders, leap across hazardous platforms, and smash dangerous bosses to halt a global catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are controlling the young hero in the original classic or dominating the battlefield as a powerful adult warrior in the sequel, prepare for pure, uncompromising arcade fun. Master your combat skills, unlock devastating weapon power-ups, and enjoy the definitive way to experience these forgotten retro gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Games in One: Play both the legendary Thunder Hoop (1992) and its simultaneous 2-player sequel TH Strikes Back (1994).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind Function: Undo costly mistakes and perfect your platforming runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save States: Save and load your game at any moment so you never lose your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Screen Filters: Relive the genuine arcade atmosphere with customizable CRT and classic TV effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer: Face the mutant hordes with a friend in alternating turns or simultaneous co-op action.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Run, shoot, and destroy hordes of mutants in the definitive Thunder Hoop collection. Take on Professor Genbreak’s bio-monsters in two explosive retro platformers, for an authentic ’90s arcade experience!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448240/f8532024f85ed74b630b1e70161215101a47282c/header.jpg?t=1787951721", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448240/c032a6dcfc9831b334cf03f4a1706e4f73105d58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787951721", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448240/c032a6dcfc9831b334cf03f4a1706e4f73105d58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787951721", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (1809 or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 @ 3.0GHz or AMD equivalent.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4600 / NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD R9 280 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processo